# H-IU1 A/B for D-IUNLINK-PREV-OF-PEER-FREED-INODE-STALE-PRECOMMIT-SHUTDOWN
# on 2/disk/caw/mpath g2d (test31 test32).  Same build for both arms:
# ~/src/mxfs-b srcversion 0DC3AB027C322D22E0D52A1, the main tree's sources
# (H-F14 included, at its default) plus the H-IU1 change: under the
# predecessor's EX hold, xfs_inactive_ifree's predecessor check requires the
# held inode to be live (mode != 0), unlinked (nlink 0) and pointing at the
# inode being freed.  Module knob unlprev_held_verify: 1 = on a miss clear the
# freed inode's prev pointer and start the free over (the preflight rebuilds the
# chain from the platter), 0 = the same-build control that proceeds as before.
# The check, its P-UNLPREV-MOVED line and the unlprev_held_moved count run in
# both settings.  Run from ~/src/mxfs-b.  Every other setting is exactly
# tests/queues/freed_nodelay_caw.queue's production settings (both test delays
# off); NG0_UNLPREV_VERIFY alternates 0 (control) and 1 (fix), and both arms
# hold the window open with NG0_UNLPREV_DELAY_MS=300 (test knob
# dbg_unlprev_wait_delay_ms: the free sleeps, holding nothing, between dropping
# the AG DLM and asking for the predecessor's hold; fn32's natural wait was
# 37 ms, and its owner removed the predecessor inside it).
#
# HYPOTHESIS H-IU1 (in the record before the patch): when xfs_inactive_ifree
# drops the AG DLM to take its predecessor's EX hold, the predecessor's owner
# can take it off the list and free it in that gap; the retry trusts the freed
# inode's in-core i_prev_unlinked without re-checking it under the hold, so
# xfs_iunlink_remove_inode edits a free inode's next pointer, the precommit
# finds NULLAGINO where it expects the freed inode, and the commit shuts the
# filesystem down.
#
# READING RULES (written before the first lap):
#   Reach is URESULT's moved: the unlprev_held_moved counters summed over the
#   nodes.  A lap without reach is UVACUOUS and counts for neither arm.
#   SUPPORTED when at least one control lap is UCONTROL-SHOWS-CAUSE (a
#   P53-IUNLINK-MISMATCH on an inode a P-UNLPREV-MOVED line of the same node
#   named as the held predecessor, followed by the precommit shutdown) and
#   every fix lap with reach is UPASS (no P53 mismatch, no node failure, audit
#   CLEAN), with at least three fix laps reaching.
#   REFUTED if a fix lap shows a P53 mismatch followed by a shutdown on a
#   remove whose held predecessor passed the check, or if every control lap
#   with moved_freed > 0 (a held predecessor read back free, fn32's shape) is
#   UCONTROL-NO-MISMATCH: the stale pointer then does not lead to the shutdown.
#   Otherwise undecided: more laps on the same rules, never a disposition.
#   Any other node failure, CORRUPT audit, stall or ABORT is attributed from its
#   own lines to its own record before anything else.  Also read on every lap:
#   SRESULT/WRESULT/CRESULT, the D-FREED F fields and the rebuild counts (a fix
#   lap's frees that ran out of tries defer to the reaper; their count is
#   P-UNLPREV-REBUILD lines with try=4).
#
# Bound: the freed_nodelay laps' 1680 s per lap (they ran 492-536 s); the
# delay adds at most 0.3 s to each predecessor wait (16-68 per node per lap on
# CAW in the freed_nodelay laps) and each rebuild's retry.
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IWR_WHOLE=1 NG0_IWR_REFUSE=1 NG0_CR63_DEFER=1 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=1 NG0_FENCE_HINT_EXEMPT=1 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 NG0_UNLPREV_VERIFY=0 NG0_UNLPREV_DELAY_MS=300 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh iub1 1 300 2/disk/caw/mpath g2d
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IWR_WHOLE=1 NG0_IWR_REFUSE=1 NG0_CR63_DEFER=1 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=1 NG0_FENCE_HINT_EXEMPT=1 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 NG0_UNLPREV_VERIFY=1 NG0_UNLPREV_DELAY_MS=300 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh iub2 1 300 2/disk/caw/mpath g2d
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IWR_WHOLE=1 NG0_IWR_REFUSE=1 NG0_CR63_DEFER=1 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=1 NG0_FENCE_HINT_EXEMPT=1 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 NG0_UNLPREV_VERIFY=0 NG0_UNLPREV_DELAY_MS=300 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh iub3 1 300 2/disk/caw/mpath g2d
